{"text":"I'm sitting in the back of a taxi with a senior Apple executive, sort of employee number 12 kind of guy, and I decide to stir the pot. And I turn to him and I say, you know, I spoke at a Microsoft summit and they gave me their new Zune, and I have to tell you, it is so much better than your iPod touch. And he turned to me and said, I have no doubt. Conversation over. Because the infinite player isn't playing to be number one every day with every product. They're playing to outlast the competition. If I had said to Microsoft, oh, I've got the new iPod touch, it's so much better than your new Zune, they would say, can we see it? What does it do? We have to see it. Because one is obsessed with their competition, the other is obsessed with why they do what they do, and the other is obsessed with where they're going.","words":[{"text":"I'm","start":0.62,"end":1.1},{"text":"sitting","start":1.1,"end":1.26},{"text":"in","start":1.26,"end":1.46},{"text":"the","start":1.46,"end":1.52},{"text":"back","start":1.52,"end":1.68},{"text":"of","start":1.68,"end":1.84},{"text":"a","start":1.84,"end":1.98},{"text":"taxi","start":1.98,"end":2.34},{"text":"with","start":2.34,"end":2.54},{"text":"a","start":2.54,"end":2.72},{"text":"senior","start":2.72,"end":3.02},{"text":"Apple","start":3.02,"end":3.32},{"text":"executive","start":3.32,"end":3.78,"punct":","},{"text":"sort","start":3.88,"end":3.94},{"text":"of","start":3.94,"end":4.04},{"text":"employee","start":4.04,"end":4.52},{"text":"number","start":4.52,"end":4.8},{"text":"12","start":4.8,"end":5.18},{"text":"kind","start":5.18,"end":5.46},{"text":"of","start":5.46,"end":5.58},{"text":"guy","start":5.58,"end":5.88,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":5.98,"end":6.6},{"text":"I","start":6.6,"end":6.9},{"text":"decide","start":6.9,"end":7.36},{"text":"to","start":7.36,"end":7.54},{"text":"stir","start":7.54,"end":7.78},{"text":"the","start":7.78,"end":7.96},{"text":"pot","start":7.96,"end":8.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","sta